Ezio and Guards
Ezio can manipulate at most X number of guards with the apple of eden.Given that there are y number of guards,predict if he safely manipulate all of them.

input
3
5 7
6 6
9 1

output
NO
YES
YES

=====
t=int(input())
for i in range(t):
    x,y=map(int,input().split())
    if x>=y:
        print("YES")
    else:
        print("NO")
